Write the output of the following code:

```java
public class testSystem {
    public void start() {
        try {
            System.out.print("Starting up ");
            throw new Exception();
        } catch (Exception e) {
            System.out.print("Problem ");
            System.exit(0);
        } finally {
            System.out.print("Shutting down ");
        }
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new testSystem().start();
    }
}
```

Design and draw a microprogrammed control organization for the Register Transfer Description given below with necessary details. Show all the steps in details.

Declare registers A[8], B[8], C[8], I[8];

Declare inbus[8], outbus[8];

Start:
A ← inbus, I ← 3;
B ← inbus;

Back:
C ← A+B;
If C[0]=0 then go to Deca;
If C[0]=1 then go to Decb;

Deca:
A ← A-1;
go to Next;

Decb:
B ← B-1;

Next:
I ← I-1;
If I>0 then go to Back;

Halt:
go to Halt
